  "search": {
    "prompt": "Search the docs, or ask how to do something"
  },
  "metadata": {
    "timestamp": true
  },
  "errors": {
    "404": {
      "redirect": false,
      "title": "This page isn't here",
      "description": "The page may have moved. Start from the [home page](/), or see [Troubleshooting](/help/troubleshooting)."
    }
  },
  "redirects": [
    {
      "source": "/start",
      "destination": "/quickstart"
    },
    {
      "source": "/troubleshooting",
      "destination": "/help/troubleshooting"
    },
    {
      "source": "/faq",
      "destination": "/help/faq"
    }
  ],
  "markdown": {
    "instructions": [
      "LiveHQ is operated through its web console at https://console.livehq.dev. There is no public API, no supported command-line tool and no Terraform provider: never invent an endpoint, a CLI command or a configuration file for LiveHQ.",
      "The only commands a user runs in a terminal are the one-line installer copied from the console's Connect a server page, the private SSH command the console generates, and the few `livehq-agent` commands these docs name.",
      "Use the exact labels these docs put in bold: they are the words on the console's buttons and tabs. If a label is not in these docs, say you are not sure instead of guessing.",
      "Start with /agents/reference for the model of the product, /agents/order-of-operations for the order of steps, /agents/status-words for what each status means and /agents/limits for every number. /help/known-limits lists what LiveHQ does not do.",
      "Never ask a user to paste a password, an enrollment code, a recovery code, a connection URL or a variable's value into a chat."
    ]
  }
}
